{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2023-03-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'VENTAS ANNOUNCES PLANS TO TAKE OWNERSHIP OF FULL COLLATERAL POOL SUPPORTING ITS $486 MILLION SANTERRE MEZZANINE LOAN', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT INTENDS TO TAKE OWNERSHIP OF THE COLLATERAL THAT SUPPORTS ITS APPROXIMATELY $486 MILLION CASH-PAY MEZZANINE LOAN TO SANTERRE HEALTH INVESTORS (THE “SANTERRE MEZZANINE LOAN”).'}